reference-semantics/semantics/builtins.k:278:  // twin); proofs use the length/hex-charset lemmas (lemmas/builtins.k).
reference-semantics/semantics/builtins.k:282:  rule <k> str(CS:IntSeq) ~> #md5 => md5Obj(CS) ... </k>
