Both target proof commands have already produced `#Top` independently, and all five LLVM assertion programs finished with `NoExc`. I’ve now assembled `prove.sh` and am running it from a clean command sequence as the final reproducibility check, including regeneration of `solution.mpy`, both compilations, both proofs, and output guards.
